meta {
  name: List My Orders
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/orders
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

params:query {
  filter: active
}

docs {
  # List Master Orders

  Paginated list of orders **assigned to** the authenticated master — work
  taken, not work ordered. Orders this account placed as a client live in
  `04_orders`.

  **Query params:**
  - `filter=active` — assigned + in_progress orders
  - `filter=history` — completed + cancelled orders
  - `filter=awaiting_response` — orders this master responded to and the
    client has not decided on yet (still `pending`, not assigned to anyone)
  - (no filter) — all orders assigned to this master

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 42,
        "status": "assigned",
        "client_name": "Merdan",
        "address": "Ashgabat, Korogly 12",
        "category": "Сантехника",
        "description": "Сломался кран",
        "created_at": "2026-05-16T10:00:00+05:00"
      }
    ],
    "meta": { "current_page": 1, "last_page": 1 }
  }
  ```
}
